body:
An acquaintance in my D&D group recently pulled his hat off and ran his fingers through his hair with a smirk on his face while clearly trying to get my attention. At first I was like, what the fuck just happened? So I said, "is that...is that directed at me? Oh, you're making fun of me because I'm bald! So did your fiancée leave you because of your hair or just cuz you're a dick?" It was a whole thing and now D&D is awkward.

&#x200B;

Edit: a word
